# Chat requests (REST Client). Sign in, create a bot and add knowledge first, same client.
# Answers stream as events: conversation {id} → text {text}... → done {message} or error.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@botId = PASTE_BOT_ID_HERE
@conversationId = PASTE_CONVERSATION_ID_HERE

### Ask in a new conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/chat
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Do you ship to Canada?"
}

### Follow-up in the same conversation (the bot remembers the last messages)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/chat
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "And how long does it take?",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}"
}

### Not in the knowledge: "done" has "answered": false
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/chat
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Do you sell espresso machines?"
}

### Conversations of the bot, most recent first
GET {{baseUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/conversations

### One conversation with all its messages and citations
GET {{baseUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}

### Delete a conversation — 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
